SI GAMES — changes.log
======================
Newest entry first. Markers: FIX = something broken, ADD = new thing,
CHG = behaviour changed, DEL = removed.

2026-11-23 — AAA interaction pass: cards, depth, sounds, smart library
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

ADD  Cinematic cards now tilt in 3D under a mouse, carry a cursor-following
     light, reveal tags and a short description on hover, and expose Play,
     Details and Favourite actions. Artwork fades in over a loading shimmer,
     errors fall back to a muted frame, and touch layouts keep the static
     presentation.

ADD  Library tools: instant search, category and genre filters, popularity /
     A-Z sorting (remembered locally), real launch counts under
     si-games-plays, plus Popular now and Recommended for you rails.

ADD  Optional interface sound system, synthesised in the browser with Web
     Audio (no audio files or new dependencies). Hover, click, navigation,
     back and launch cues are unlocked only by a user gesture. Toggles and
     volume sliders live in both the launcher Settings screen and /settings.
     Nothing autoplays.

ADD  Cursor-reactive ambience: a soft pointer light, parallax colour fields
     and three floating 3D wireframe forms on the shared backdrop. Reduced
     motion and coarse pointers disable the layer.

ADD  Custom cursor now uses a glow halo and trailing particle, and switches
     to a larger spectral ring over game cards. Disabled for touch and
     reduced-motion visitors.

