2026-11-18 — mobile rendering sharpness
----------------------------------------

FIX  Embedded game builds are served with a device-width viewport when they
     do not carry one. Phones were laying them out at ~980px and shrinking the
     result, which made games look soft and tiny. Builds with their own
     viewport keep it untouched.

FIX  The five local games without a viewport now declare a width matched to
     their fixed boards (Candy Crush, 2048, Ping Pong, Tetris, Quiz), and three
     malformed <head> tags were repaired.

CHG  Portrait intro film now uses contain instead of cover, so the phone does
     not crop the sides and upscale a low-detail centre.

CHG  Mobile search and form fields use a 16px base so iOS does not zoom the
     whole page on focus.

