2026-11-14 — PlayTab arcade import, in-frame HTML loader
--------------------------------------------------------

ADD  832 PlayTab arcade titles, deduped against the existing library. Their
     play pages send X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN and frame-ancestors 'self', so
     the player now fetches each game's own HTML from the CORS-open jsDelivr
     mirror and renders it as the frame's srcdoc, keeping the HTML's own asset
     base intact. 755 titles use that route, 77 embed a direct build, and 5
     hosts that still refuse framing hand over their link. Covers and ids come
     from the PlayTab catalog (src/data/bigPicture.ts); titles already in the
     library were skipped.

CHG  The player frame accepts an optional htmlUrl: while the document loads it
     shows a "Loading the game..." state, and a fetch failure reports the build
     as unavailable instead of leaving a blank TV.

